50:Messenger: Malcolm... Malcolm!!
51:Malcolm: What's the matter?
52:Messenger: Someone is attacking Valtaria from the north.
53:Malcolm: So what are you waiting for? Ride to defend the kingdom.
54:Messenger: You don't understand. He destroyed the walls and seems to have Truth's armor.
55:Malcolm: That's impossible. The armor is Dyron's and he wears it all the time.
56:Eryth: Did I miss something?

57:"Guest": Hello, legendary Malcolm.
58:Malcolm: ...
59:"Guest": I advise you to leave this place, or you will be destroyed along with it.
60:Malcolm: For 500 years, humans have been trying to conquer Valtaria. This attack will withstand it too. 
61:"Guest": Is that so?
62:"Guest": Run, legend! Soon your time will pass and a NEW legend will rise.
63:Hold off your opponent as long as possible.
64:This command will also be useful: /Mortius